# In the Blood (ToAU 32) with the RoV era module: the 3113 finish sets the Timer to JST midnight (1, expiring then),
# with the same local mustZone var. Naja's trigger again: 3120; a JST day on: 3130, finished: Sentinels' Honor
# completed (33 current).
module modules/era/lua/missions/mission_adjustments.lua
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Naja_Salaheem/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/3113
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=40,-6,-30 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Toau InTheBlood current
setting RESTRICT_CONTENT 1
setting ENABLE_ROV 0
login
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # 3113
finish                                  # completed, the Timer 1
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # Sentinels' Honor: the Timer holds: 3120
finish-if-event
wait jst=1                              # the Timer expired
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # 3130
finish-if-event
